# 14. The most important new insight

The genuine advance produced by joining Levin and Abhinavagupta is a new way of understanding **contraction**.

Contraction need not mean that an infinite ghost literally squeezes itself into a body.

It can mean:

> A universal space of causal and experiential possibilities becomes a finite perspective through the formation of boundaries, reference frames, preferences, temporal horizons and action capacities.

This is exactly what an organism is.

It excludes almost everything so that something can matter.

```text
total possibility
      ↓ constraint
particular sensors
particular needs
particular memories
particular actions
      ↓
a world-for-this-agent
```

From the outside, this is biological individuation.

From the inside, it is the birth of a world.

The *kañcukas* describe its phenomenological dimensions. Markov blankets describe statistical separation. Cognitive light cones describe its operational reach. Active inference describes its self-maintaining activity. Vimarśa describes its intrinsic reflexivity.

That is the core synthesis.

